lens_profiles.invalid = Hitamwo ububiko bw’amakuru bwa XML Lensfun v1/v2 bwemewe (butarenza 8 MiB) bufise amakuru ya kamera canke lentille bishigikiwe.
lens_profiles.calibration = Gupima neza lentille
lens_profiles.no_calibration = Nta bipimo bihuye n’aya magenamiterere. Suzuma uburebure bwa fokus n’igipimo co gukata ca kamera; gukosora n’intoke biracashoboka.
lens_profiles.import = Kwinjiza XML ya Lensfun…
lens_profiles.imported = Ububiko bw’amakuru bwa Lensfun bwinjijwe muri iki kiringo. Hitamwo profil canke uyigereranye n’amakuru y’ifoto.
lens_profiles.manual = Gukosora n’intoke gusa
lens_profiles.saved = Ibipimo vyabitswe (ububiko bw’amakuru ntibuboneka)
lens_profiles.profile = Profil ya lentille
lens_profiles.aperture = Ubugari bw’ifunguka (0 = ntibizwi)
lens_profiles.distance = Intera ya fokus (0 = ntibizwi)
lens_profiles.vignette = Gukosora umwiza wo ku mpande hakurikijwe ibipimo
lens_profiles.color_context = Gukosora umwiza wo ku mpande hakurikijwe ibipimo bisaba profil ya sRGB iri muri porogarama. Hindura ifoto ibe sRGB kugira ngo igume isa uko yari, hanyuma wongere wugurure Gukosora lentille. Ku mapikiseli asanzwe ari sRGB ariko atagira ikimenyetso ca profil, kuyaha profil ya sRGB birahagije. Gukosora imiterere n’amabara biracashoboka.
lens_profiles.vignette_missing = Nta bipimo vy’umwiza wo ku mpande bihuye n’ubugari bw’ifunguka n’intera ya fokus. Shiramwo ibipimo vyafashwe kugira ngo bikore; muri profil nyinshi za Lensfun, 1000 m yerekana fokus ya kure.
lens_profiles.note = Gukosora hakurikijwe ibipimo bikorwa imbere y’ivyokosorwa n’intoke. Koresha ifoto yose y’intango, uyikate mu nyuma. Bika urukurikirane rw’amafiltiri muri PSD/PSB kugira ngo ibipimo bishobore guhindurwa.
lens_profiles.automatic = Guhuza n’amakuru y’ifoto
lens_profiles.components = Ivyakozwe na profil: kugorama {distortion}; imirongo y’amabara ku mpande {tca}; umwiza wo ku mpande {vignette}.
